SUMMARY:Infinite Circle Community: Integration Circle
DESCRIPTION:Our Integration Circles are a time for the Infinite Circle Community to reflect on the practice theme for the month\, sharing how the readings and embodied practices have shifted\, or not\, our way of seeing the world. We alternate between Council and Dialogue practices to provide the container for members to explore how our practice topics have been working in our lives. Visit the IC Community Table and use the ICC zoom link to join at 7:30pm EST. If you are interested on learning more about the Infinite Circle Community\, or how to join\, please email us.
URL:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/event/infinite-circle-community-integration-circle-2/2026-10-22/
LOCATION:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/event/infinite-circle-community-integration-circle-2/2026-10-22/
CATEGORIES:Infinite Circle Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Infinite-Circle-10x9-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
