SUMMARY:Precepts Renewal Ceremony (online and in person)
DESCRIPTION:Every month on the full moon\, we recommit ourselves to the peacemaker precepts in a beautiful ceremony of chanting and bows (fusatsu) held during meditation. \nRegister here for the Zoom link to join us online (the link is the same for all public dharma talks and ceremonies).
