SUMMARY:Bernie Glassman Memorial: "Bernie on the Street" (a ZPI event)
DESCRIPTION:Bernie on the Street: A Panel Discussion\nA Zen Peacemakers Event\nOctober 31\, 2026\n12:00 – 1:30 pm Eastern \nJoin us to celebrate Bernie Glassman’s life and legacy through his groundbreaking work with Street Retreats. \nWe’ll begin with a conversation with Sensei Jorge Koho Mello\, Sensei Mikko Ijäs\, Sensei Joshin Byrnes\, and Jürgen Lembke. Together\, we’ll explore how this practice continues today and what its future might hold. \nAll are welcome to join us in remembering Bernie and reflecting on this living practice of bearing witness. \nNote: This is a Zen Peacemakers event\, hosted through their website. You can register for the event here.
URL:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/event/bernie-glassman-memorial-bernie-on-the-street-a-zpi-event/
LOCATION:VT
CATEGORIES:Online
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/homeles-bernie2-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
