SUMMARY:Intro to Zen Practice
DESCRIPTION:Intro to Zen Practice (One Hour)\nCurious about Zen\, meditation\, or Bread Loaf Mountain Zen Community? This one-hour introduction offers a simple\, down-to-earth entry into our practice and community. \nWe’ll cover the basics of Zen practice\, including posture and breath\, what we mean by “just sitting\,” and how practice connects with everyday life. There will be time for a short period of meditation and space for questions. \nThis session is open to newcomers as well as those who want a refresher. No prior experience is needed. \nOffered monthly\, alternating between in-person at Bread Loaf Mountain Zen Community and online via Zoom. \nIn person\nIn person on 1st Thursday of the even month from 5:30-6:30pm EST   \nPlease fill out this form it you want to join in person \nBread Loaf Mountain Zen Community\nNo Barriers Temple\n76 Court Street\, Middlebury\, VT \nOnline\nOnline on 1st Sunday of the uneven month from 12-1pm EST \nEnter online zendo
URL:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/event/intro-to-zen-practice/2026-11-01/
LOCATION:Online
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/BLMZC-zendo-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
