SUMMARY:Meditation for a Shared World
DESCRIPTION:During the month of November\, we will be offering an experiential series on Buddhist meditation exploring the different styles of\nmeditation practice that have arisen as the Dharma evolved over the last few millennia. We will practice with guided meditations\nusing objects and themes\, as well as the method-less method found in Dogen’s Zen. We will also discuss how we take our experience on the cushion out into and for the world. These sessions can be taken as a series or as stand-alone sessions\, and they will be suitable for beginners as well as experienced meditators. \nThese are a series of meditation trainings that can be taken as a series or as stand-alone sessions\, and they will be suitable for beginners as well as experienced meditators. Full guidance will be given\, the meditations will be guided There will be a Q&A from 6:15pm. \nEnter Online Zendo\nSchedule: \nNovember 2nd: Foundations of Mindfulness \n\nJoin Eisho for a training in the Four Foundations of Mindfulness (Satipatthana) one of the Buddha&#39;s core teachings on meditation – a way of training our attention across four areas of experience: the body\, feelings\, the mind\, and mental phenomena.\n\nNovember 9th: Divine Abodes \n\nAt this brief evening training\, we will be guided through the Brahmaviharas–the Divine Abodes. Eisho will introduce each of the qualities\, and lead guided meditations through all four in sequence\, opening our hearts to Loving-kindness\, Compassion\, Sympathetic Joy\, and Equanimity.\n\nNovember 16th: Silence & Illumination \n\nDuring this training Eisho will look at ‘Calming’ – the calming and steadying of attention\, and the ‘Clear Seeing’ that arises once the mind is quiet enough to look. Eisho will guide us to sit in silence\, a silence that can allow illumination.\n\nNovember 23rd: Just Sitting \n\nIn the last of our Meditation Workshops\, Eisho will guide us into one of our core Zen practices – Just Sitting (Shikantaza)\, no goal\, no striving–presence itself.
URL:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/event/meditation-for-a-shared-world/
LOCATION:VT
CATEGORIES:Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://breadloafmountainzen.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Picture1-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
